{
  "caption_latex": "\\textbf{Adding messages, placing them, and sustaining their benefit are different problems.} Native edges are retained while a fixed budget is added from the local annulus (schematic; self-messages omitted). The cards separate training, placement on matched observed test histories, and autonomous feedback. Triplets show seeds 0, 1, and 2 for each named contrast; negative means lower error or a smaller risk-minus-random gap. The cross retains Goop's undefined full-horizon interaction.",
  "dimensions_pt": [
    470,
    238
  ],
